  "description": "Connects the OASIS to Holochain -- a post-blockchain, agent-centric distributed computing framework enabling truly P2P applications without global consensus. Each agent runs their own chain; data is shared on a DHT. HoloOASIS is the original OASIS decentralised backend, storing holons and avatars directly on the Holochain DHT via HoloNET. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
